    "component_id": "C051.signal_basis",
    "value": "The procedure reconstructs configurations from records while retaining missing information as unknown, then tests reductions for repeated failure. Smaller configurations can preserve lateness while specified further removals cease to reproduce it; uncertain or inconsistent tests remain unresolved.",
